config VIMAR_LOADER_RUNTIME_V2
    bool "Opt-in typed common-loader runtime contract"
    depends on SOC_NRF52840 && VIMAR_OTA_SPLIT_STAGING
    default n
    help
      Requires a finite generated typed loader-contract header. Common families
      require a committed anchor and local live UID/UICR/geometry validation.
      Existing READ0 and exact legacy default remain unchanged. READ1 is added
      only to authenticated recovery identity when this option is explicitly on.
